  "statement": "Veronika Bondarenko is an artist living and working in Toronto, Ontario. Her interdisciplinary practice surrounds conceptions of colour, light, and the enduring or timeless, as experienced through process-oriented technical approaches and prolonged meditative looking. She is currently pursuing a BFA in Drawing and Painting from OCAD University.",
